"The Declared prepare for their knight oaths in a cottage of oaths, contemplating chosen memories."
"As the age of closure nears, the chance to declare for knighthood fades."
"Announcing one's choice too hastily is frowned upon."
"Elders advise Rapport and outsider declared not to grow attached or become learning partners."
"A declared wears the mark of the declaration on one shoulder of the coat."
